            "created_at": "2025-09-01T02:51:25.451949+00:00",
            "notes": "This round the power should be picked based on your survivability or the enemy team. \n\nIf you are facing against an Ashe or Ana, CLEANSING CHARGE will be most helpful. If you are having a hard time staying alive, it would be more beneficial to select SELF-CARE.\n\nHere you want to really focus cool down reduction. The more you can spam your abilities, the more you can keep your team alive. If possible, try to buy IRIDESCENT IRISY, MARTIAN MENDER, and  HARDLIGHT ECCELERATOR. If you cannot afford all 3, removing HARDLIGHT ACCELERATOR would be the best choice. \n\nIf you have any leftover cash, focus most on cooldown reduction and ability power. Items I recommend are MULTI-TOOL, ICY COOLANT, or POWER PLAYBOOK.",
